                Vermilion.inSignedRange 64 b1 →
                  Vermilion.inSignedRange 64 b2 →
                    Vermilion.inSignedRange 64 b3 →
                      Vermilion.inSignedRange 64 b4 →
                        Vermilion.inSignedRange 64 cb →
                          -4611686018427387903 ≤ ca ∧ ca ≤ 4611686018427387903 →
                            -4611686018427387903 ≤ cb ∧ cb ≤ 4611686018427387903 →
                              BoundedBridge.returnedTwo a0 a1 a2 a3 a4 ca b0 b1 b2 b3 b4 cb =
